  "details": "Would it be possible to add an extra setting to phys bones which acts like the friction part of dynamic bones. friction helps allot when your trying to make something on a model actually move realistically. for example, moving your leg up whilst the model has a skirt, without friction the leg moves in-between the phys bones. with friction, the phys bones would stay ontop of the leg more, stopping your leg going through the skirt.",
